  "schema:name": "Feedback & Learning Service",
  "schema:description": "This application service delivers performance feedback, recommendations, and learning resources to healthcare providers and organizations based on quality monitoring results. It supports organizational learning and continuous improvement initiatives.\r\n\r\nThe purpose is to encourage corrective actions and strengthens healthcare quality improvement capabilities. It also promotes knowledge sharing and adoption of best practices.\r\n\r\nExample: Clinicians receive feedback reports highlighting areas with low compliance to clinical care standards.",
